# Free Battle vs COM with rental teams at Lv.51: 1P enters ボーイ (Venusaur, Charizard, Blastoise, Pikachu, Lapras,
# Snorlax), the COM ミニスカ (Gengar, Electrode, Starmie, Clefable, ...). 1P picks all six on the order screen (a Free
# Battle takes the whole team). Turn 1 Venusaur's first move, turn 2 switch to Charizard (B, then C-Left), turns 3-4
# Charizard's moves on C-Up, C-Right; Charizard faints in turn 4, A sends out the next (Snorlax), turns 5-6 its C-Up and
# C-Right moves. Random numbers seeded, sync points at each command phase and move.
